    "0. Run Prepare-LpMonnowPrinterPublish.ps1 -OpenFolder; compile prefab/vmdl/sounds in editor; re-run script to pick up _c files.",
    "1. Addon lpmonnowsprinterupgrade publish Rev 3+ (Assets MUST include monnow_printer.prefab under addons/lifepunch/monnow-printer-lp/).",
    "2. Gamemode -> Addons -> enable lpmonnowsprinterupgrade + pin new revision.",
    "3. Gamemode -> Content -> PrimaryReference stays addons/lifepunch/monnow-printer-lp/monnow_printer.prefab (do NOT point at lpmonnowsprinterupgrade/models).",
    "4. Gamemode -> Entities -> link each row to its content id; set limit per player (2 default).",
    "5. Gamemode -> Market -> type Entity; referenceId = entity id; grouping #entity.category.upgradableprinter; set cost + role whitelist/blacklist.",
    "6. Sync Servers + market buy test: printer spawns at aim ray (GetPrefab must succeed)."
  ]
